Error [jet.InvalidStatement]: `sql"…"` is a retired text prefix
  --> tests/ui/retired_text_prefix_names_its_head.jet:5:12
    |
  5 |     query: sql"select * from t where id = {id}"
    |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A checked text value writes its type as the head and its text as the quoted body; Jet has no string prefixes
 Fix: Write `SQL{"…"}`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
